          <td data-label="Why">It reduces bias.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>Trials after guidance</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Good</td>
          <td data-label="Why">They test fit.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>Sharing data with unknown sites</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Risky</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Spam risk.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="evidence">What can be said with confidence, and what cannot</h2>

  <p>
    
  </p>
