      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Institutions.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Plan notes.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Quality varies.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Add trials.</p>
    </div>
